Mod for No Man's Sky that allows players to offer a configurable amount of alien gifts in one interaction, while also allowing the user to choose if they want the dialogue screen with the alien to stay open. Autophage have separate controls for applying the multiplier and for keeping and cycling their gift option.

[size=4][b]Downloading[/b][/size]

The only places this mod should be downloaded from are:

[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/4774]Nexus Mods[/url]
[*][url=https://github.com/scottdraper8/generous-giver/releases]GitHub release page[/url]
[/list]

[quote][b]Warning[/b]

Official downloads are available only from Nexus Mods and GitHub Releases. Please report copies found elsewhere so their license compliance can be reviewed.[/quote]

[size=4][b]Installing[/b][/size]

Install the archive with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/vortex]Vortex[/url] or [url=https://github.com/ChrisDKN/Amethyst-Mod-Manager]Amethyst Mod Manager[/url]. Choose a gift amount and dialogue behavior for Gek, Korvax, and Vy'keen on the first FOMOD page. The second page controls whether the multiplier applies to Autophage and whether their gift option stays available and cycles to a new gift. The recommended defaults enable the Autophage multiplier and keep and cycle their gift option.

All eight optional manual archives enable the Autophage multiplier. Dialogue Open archives keep and cycle the Autophage gift option; Dialogue Closed archives close it and remove the ability to regift that NPC. The release still provides one FOMOD installer and the same eight manual quantity/dialogue downloads.

